overflow: hidden;\n    background: #ffd51b;\n  }\n\n  .attendance {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n    width: 626px;\n    color: #222;\n    font-size: 31px;\n    line-height: 32px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: -1.5px;\n  }\n\n  .date {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    line-height: 30px;\n  }\n\n  .publisher {\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: 2;\n    left: 25px;\n    bottom: 13px;\n    width: 420px;\n    font: 8px/10px \"Courier New\", Courier, monospace;\n    letter-spacing: .1px;\n  }\n\n  .diagonal-notice {\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: 5;\n    width: 393px;\n    height: 110px;\n    right: -61px;\n    bottom: 30px;\n    padding: 5px 12px;\n    transform: rotate(-34deg);\n    transform-origin: center;\n    border: 6px solid #282828;\n    background: #f5f1e8;\n    color: #292929;\n  }\n\n  .diagonal-title {\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    line-height: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n\n  .diagonal-details {\n    margin: 1px 0 0 92px;\n    width: 235px;\n    font: 7px/8px \"Courier New\", Courier, monospace;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"poster\">\n  <header class=\"top-title\">HAVE YOU SEEN THESE MEN?</header>\n\n  <section class=\"top-black-panel\">\n    <div class=\"portraits\">\n      <div class=\"portrait-column\">\n        <div class=\"portrait placeholder\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder-label\">[Photograph: Lee Kuan Yew]</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"identity\">\n          <div class=\"name\">LEE KUAN YEW</div>\n          <div class=\"details\">\n            Prime Minister of Singapore<br>\n            Graduate from CAMBRIDGE<br>\n            Worked for Japanese fascists in the 2nd World War.\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"portrait-column\">\n        <div class=\"portrait right placeholder\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder-label\">[Photograph: Hussein Onn]</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"identity\">\n          <div class=\"name\">HUSSEIN ONN</div>\n          <div class=\"details\">\n            Prime Minister of Malaysia<br>\n            Trained by the British army in Malaya,India,Middle-East<br>\n            Graduate from LINCOLN'S INN (London)\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"accusation\">\n      <h2>PREPETRATORS OF CRIMES AGAINST THE</h2>\n      <h3>PEOPLE OF MALAYSIA AND SINGAPORE</h3>\n      <div class=\"accusation-text\">\n        <p>To maintain the interests of British and other foreign capital<br>\n        and the local elites, THEY</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>SUPPRESS workers' and peasants' rights.</li>\n          <li>BAN independent trade unions and student unions.</li>\n          <li>MANIPULATE judicial process.</li>\n          <li>SUPPRESS parliamentary democracy and press freedom.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"kill-banner\">THEY JAIL AND KILL PEOPLE</div>\n\n  <section class=\"connection-box\">\n    <div class=\"connection-title\">THE BRITISH CONNECTION</div>\n\n    <div class=\"connection-content\">\n      <div class=\"recovery\">\n        RUBBER AND TIN from colonial Malaya were crucial to British<br>\n        postwar recovery.\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"evidence-photo left placeholder\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder-label\">[Photograph: bottom-left]</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"middle-copy\">\n        <p>\"Without Malaya, the Sterling System, as we know<br>\n        it could not exist.\"&nbsp; Purcell</p>\n\n        <p>A 12-year British Military Rule was imposed after<br>\n        the World War II to protect British economic interests.</p>\n\n        <p>Repressive laws were first introduced by the British<br>\n        colonial regime, then further improved by the local<br>\n        elites.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"evidence-photo right placeholder\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder-label\">[Photograph: bottom-right]</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"influence\">\n        <p>Though formally 'independent', Britain CONTINUES to exert influence<br>\n        and control through</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Domination of the economies</li>\n          <li>Collaboration with the repressive regimes</li>\n          <li>Cultural subversion</li>\n          <li>Five-Power-Defence-Arrangement (U.K., Australia, New Zealand,</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"continuation\">Malaysia and Singapore).</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"bottom-area\">\n    <div class=\"attendance\">\n      BELIEVED TO BE IN LONDON ATTENDING<br>\n      THE COMMONWEALTH PM CONF.<br>\n      <span class=\"date\">JUNE 8-16,1977</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"publisher\">\n      Published by COBRA and NUS<br>\n      COBRA - Conference for Basic Human and Democratic Rights in the ASEAN alliance<br>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6, Endsleigh Street&nbsp; London WC1\n    </div>\n\n    <aside class=\"diagonal-notice\">\n      <div class=\"diagonal-title\">PICKET LEE AND HUSSEIN ONN</div>\n      <div class=\"diagonal-details\">\n        Place: Parliament Square, London SW1<br>\n        Date: 9th June '77<br>\n        Time: 6.15 p.m.<br>\n        [illegible] LETTERS OF protest<br>\n        SEND: [illegible]<br>\n        c/o [illegible] House,<br>\n        [illegible] Road,<br>\n        London [illegible]<br>\n        Copies to COBRA.\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n  </section>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>",
